WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.610
Okay, Misha-chan. See you tomorrow.

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:06.550
Yeah, talk to you later.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.000
Oh? So, you're...

00:01:56.260 --> 00:02:01.760
<b>Episode 6: Our Maid's Girl From The Past?</b>

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.500
Pure white skin...

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.800
Sparkling blonde hair...

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.630
Eyes like jade...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.180
And lips the color of peach blossoms.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.940
I see.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.440
I can see why she'd be obsessed—

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:17.180
No, I'm not doing anything...

00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:18.490
H-Hey!

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:23.120
<b>Beware
of
molesters</b>

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.570
A strange girl approached me!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.520
I'm concerned!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:24.580
Why not take a seat right over there?

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.920
Huh? What?

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:28.910
Wait!

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.940
I still need to talk to her!

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:31.650
Hey!

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.930
Stop!

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.090
Stop right there!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.530
Damn it! Where did she go?

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.880
Damn it. They won't even listen
to what a girl's trying to say...

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:54.450
You there.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:56.720
I saw you.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:59.400
You were with that other young girl.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:01.270
There's something I want to ask you.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.660
Somebody save me!

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.200
H-Hey...

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:08.290
Over there!

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.540
Get her!

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:15.430
N-No, I haven't done anything.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:19.150
Listen to me!

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:25.100
I guess there are more female 
lolicons than I thought.

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.180
The world sucks.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:33.690
Welcome back, Milady.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.940
Is there something wrong?

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.040
And now you show up.

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:39.660
You're like the embodiment of all 
female lolicons crammed into one monster!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:41.820
What are you talking about?

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.220
Nothing.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.200
What is my snack today?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.460
Well, it's fall now, so I have some 
Japanese sweet potato and cream pancakes.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.290
That sounds really good!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.270
I'll bring them to your room.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.010
Very well!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:02.220
<i>And you have no clue what I'm doing 
while I'm eating the goodies you made.</i>

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.340
<b>How to get rid of a lolicon</b>

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.470
<b>How to get rid of someone that annoys you</b>

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.590
<b>How to legally take care of...</b>

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:09.860
<i>The fact that I'm trying to get rid of you!</i>

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:11.270
<i></i>

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:14.350
<i>Hold on a second... I feel like I'm 
being watched through the window again.</i>

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.900
<i>She's doing it again.</i>

00:04:20.390 --> 00:04:23.280
Hey, stop wasting time and get me my food—

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:33.790
Milady!

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:38.520
How many times do I have to tell 
you to stop breaking down the door?!

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.420
I'll fix it later.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.050
In any event...

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.140
It's been a while, First Lieutenant Ukai.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.510
You know her?

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.070
I am no longer part of 
the Self-Defense Force.

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:53.720
You do not have to address
 me as "First Lieutenant."

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:54.770
Then what would you prefer?

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:58.770
Please call me M-Midorin.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:04:59.900
What?

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.620
My name is Ukai Midori, so...

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.110
Midorin.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.150
We don't really have that 
sort of relationship, though.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:09.490
That was cold.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:11.410
Yeah, you're being cold!

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:14.460
I made lunch.

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.420
Wow!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.170
Midori

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:23.000
We all ate the same lunch back on the force.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.920
Flower viewing party

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.920
We just all went to have lunch together.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.430
Your food is extremely good.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:31.430
I want to eat your food once agai—

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.850
No.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:35.550
Then how about twice—

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:36.600
No.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.270
Three times!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.380
No.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.730
Why do you keep asking for more?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.380
Then every day!

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:44.070
Never.

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.680
I have decided that the person 
I will serve forever...

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:51.580
is Milady, and her alone.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.620
Don't decide that!

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.660
Please leave.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.620
I'll pay you three times as much as they do.

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.530
Money isn't the issue.

00:06:01.530 --> 00:06:04.310
If you don't leave...

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:06.270
Hello, is this the police?

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:07.870
There's a strange person 
outside of our window...

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.510
You're one to talk!

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.420
I didn't call.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:21.020
Huh?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.310
Call it pity for my former SO.

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:25.070
And you didn't ask to take that picture!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.360
Jeez, when did you take so many pictures...

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:49.550
Oh, yeah. You said she was your SO?

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:53.360
Air Self-Defense Force,
First Lieutenant Ukai Midori.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.920
Thirty-three years of age.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:56.600
She had black hair back in the day.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.030
I didn't know she had 
left the force, however.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:02.270
Is the JSDF full of perverts?

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:04.520
<i>Wait a second.</i>

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.530
<i>If she came to try to get our maid...</i>

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:11.280
<i>Maybe I'll be able to push her 
away from me and onto Midorin.</i>

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.780
<i>I'm going to find Midorin!</i>

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.160
These are good.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:17.540
<i>Hmm?</i>

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:21.300
In any event, I'm going to go 
out to buy things for dinner.

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.810
Please watch the house for me.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.670
Oh, I'm going to head out, too.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.090
You mean you want to go with me—

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.300
No, not with you!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.270
<i>I have no clue where Midorin might be.</i>

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.680
<i>But she did say one thing...</i>

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:38.980
Your food is extremely good.

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:40.980
I want to eat your food once...

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:45.180
<i>That means Midorin craves that woman's food.</i>

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:46.320
<i>In that case...</i>

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:49.320
<i>I'll use her Japanese pancake pastry!</i>

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.970
<i>This should get Midorin to come!</i>

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.870
<i>This plan is kind of...</i>

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.080
<i>That woman's stupidity must
 be rubbing off on me.</i>

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.790
<i>I need to get to Midorin as fast as possible.</i>

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.540
Midorin!

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.420
I didn't think I'd really 
get her like this.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.650
What are you doing?

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.560
You, huh?

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.830
I'm garbage, so I'm waiting to be 
picked up with the other garbage.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.490
What's so strange about that?

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.280
What a pain...

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.320
Not very adult, either.

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:31.730
I came here to chase after the person I love.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.070
I was completely rejected.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.320
Huh? Person you love?

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:41.810
<i>She's crying?</i>

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:45.580
<i>Midorin must really like...</i>

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.840
Huh?!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.090
I was completely rejected.

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.620
Completely...

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.220
Th-This is great!

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:00.230
Huh?

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:02.390
I was rejected again!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.430
I knew there could be no one else for me!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:11.190
And just like that, 
Ukai Midori has recovered!

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.770
Is there something you 
want from me, little girl?

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.070
Hold on, my brain can't 
keep up with all of this.

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:19.750
Just say what's on your
 mind one thing at a time.

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.700
And now she's acting normal.

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.070
Well...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:24.870
What do you mean, "the person you love"?

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:29.050
Your maid.

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:29.840
Why?

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.840
Well, that's a foolish question.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:34.680
She's like the embodiment of Venus—

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:36.880
the beauty and wonder of all 
women crammed into one person.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.090
Could anyone not like her?

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:42.070
I don't want to live on this planet anymore.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.850
Don't say that!

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:47.560
I'll explain this simply for you.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.650
I'll explain just how our love started.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.110
<i>This is going to be a waste of time.</i>

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:56.560
We first met when Kamoi was 
transferred from her fighter unit

00:09:56.560 --> 00:10:00.370
to the military canine unit
 where I was assigned.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.490
Military working... dog handler...?

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:07.180
It's a place where we train the military 
dogs that guard bases.

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:09.890
But aren't you in the 
Japan Air Self-Defense Force?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:12.220
Don't you fly around in fighter jets?

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:13.130
I mean...

00:10:14.020 --> 00:10:16.850
And that's when I decided I 
wanted to fly through the sky.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:28.020
<b>Aviation
Air Traffic Control
Electronic Signals
Research & Development
Maintenance
Sanitation
Weather
Anti-Aircraft
Security
Supply</b>

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:21.200
It's true that many think of the 
Japan Air Self-Defense Force

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.190
as pilots for fighter aircraft 
and transport craft,

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:27.000
but there's approximately thirty 
different jobs that make up the Force.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.170
What?!

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.270
<b>Aviation <-- Pilots fall here
Air Traffic Control
Electronic Signals
Research & Development
Maintenance
Sanitation
Weather
Anti-Aircraft
Security
Supply</b>

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.270
Pilots only make up a small 
portion of one of those groups.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:34.400
<i>I wonder if that woman didn't
 get the job she wanted.</i>

00:10:34.820 --> 00:10:36.400
And back in those days...

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:40.910
I believed that gaining the trust of the 
dogs was essential to their training,

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.260
and tried my hardest to make 
my way into their hearts.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.160
Good work, Meteor!

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:50.810
And when Meteor obeyed me,

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.740
when he had obeyed no one else,

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:55.860
I couldn't have been happier.

00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:57.960
And that's when...

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.550
...that woman was assigned to us.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.780
What's up with you guys?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.730
Meteor, you too?!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:25.450
It was her... Kamoi Tsubame.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:31.040
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:36.040
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.500
Why did the dogs act like that?

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:40.720
The animals could feel it inside of them.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:44.390
They could instinctively 
feel her overwhelming aura.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:49.680
My year of work was made 
light of in a second.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.770
That's terrible.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:54.450
I felt embarrassed, having my connection 
with the dogs taken away like that.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:55.640
And that's when I...

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:56.440
Gulp.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.160
Wait!

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.160
Why would that happen?!

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.780
And that's when I fell in love.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.200
I don't get it.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:13.520
I got as close to the 
dogs' hearts as I could,

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:17.740
and as a result, I was attracted to the 
concept of someone that is the leader of a pack.

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.920
I don't get it at all.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:21.460
And from that day forward,

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.490
my bittersweet love story 
continued on every day.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.180
She's not listening to me at all.

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.140
And one day in the kennel...

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:39.200
First Lieutenant, what are you doing?

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:40.410
Are you bored?

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:42.030
Please get back to work.

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:45.950
And another time during training...

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:47.410
Go!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.970
First Lieutenant, what are you doing?

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.180
You're on duty.

00:13:04.180 --> 00:13:06.130
Please stop playing around.

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:11.100
And another time during feeding...

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.530
First Lieutenant, what are
 you trying to pull?

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.270
Why do you have this bowl?

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:27.240
I'm not giving you food.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.600
I was her superior, but she got 
angry and yelled at me anyway.

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:34.810
I was so happy.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:37.750
I know I keep saying this, 
but I don't understand you.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.840
The reason why these ribbons on my 
head look like dog ears is because

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.500
I keep cognizant of the 
time I spent back then.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:44.460
I don't care.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.650
I forgot to tell you,

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:49.350
but I'm rather masochistic, 
and love being treated coldly.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:51.600
You're talking to a child over here.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.120
The reason why I requested security 
after joining the force was because

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.580
I heard it was difficult to do so.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:57.770
I would think anything military is...

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.770
It turns out it was the 
training that was difficult.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.650
The training was so hard,

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:10.530
that even as a woman,
 my abs started to get toned.

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.330
But...

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.040
Kamoi is just as female as I am,

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.040
and she had a wonderful six-pack
—much better than I could do.

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:24.040
By the way, you call a pack of 
six eggs a six-pack, as well.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.170
Why would you think I care?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:30.840
I felt frustrated having to see 
Kamoi's trained body everyday.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:31.850
Huh?

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.970
But that frustration felt so good!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.480
I knew it'd be something like that.

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.600
Hand-to-hand combat training 
was also essential.

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.330
I was rather good myself, but...

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.360
Kamoi went to a whole other domain.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.990
However, while I couldn't beat 
her in stamina or power...

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:54.450
I was a tiny bit better 
than her at strategy.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:05.130
I strategically made 
Kamoi hurt me constantly.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.280
She fell right into my trap.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.630
And I'm going to keep saying this,
 but I don't get you at all.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:15.640
But an end came to those wonderful days.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.300
Kamoi suddenly left the force.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.150
That day, I...

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:27.780
Wait, Kamoi!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.900
Why are you so focused on me?

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.700
W-Well, I...

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:36.160
...love you.

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:39.440
<i>I didn't mean to say that!</i>

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.510
<i>But it feels kind of nice to 
have screwed up like this.</i>

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.180
First Lieutenant...

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:49.350
I have absolutely no interest in anyone

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.170
who has already had her first period.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.800
I was so happy.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.590
I was rejected the hardest I had ever been.

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:56.260
Hey.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:56.790
Hmm?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:59.660
Why did she leave the JSDF?

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.690
You haven't heard?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:02.810
Yeah.

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:04.410
I see.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:06.190
Then I can't tell you.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:09.690
It's a secret between Kamoi and me.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.660
I don't really care.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:19.150
And then it was like my 
life had lost all vibrancy.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.680
The dogs started getting upset

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:24.500
and acted up because their
 boss suddenly disappeared.

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.710
I did the same.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:27.750
You, too?!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:33.260
<b>Kamoi
 Subordinates
 Dogs
 Me</b>

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:30.110
When Kamoi came,

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:33.260
the hierarchy changed such that I was 
put on the bottom of the pyramid,

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:36.010
and because of that,
 the dogs stopped obeying me,

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.510
and my subordinates would frown at me.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.870
And while I did think what was happening

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:43.140
was kind of nice because 
I'm a masochist at heart,

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:46.160
I was left with a hole ripped in my heart.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:51.150
<b>I'm quitting.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:50.370
I decided to chase after Kamoi,
and leave the force.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.110
So that means...

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.740
<b>Bam</b>

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.540
I have no job!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:58.530
I'm surprised you said you'd hire her

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.770
and pay her three times 
what we're paying, then.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:03.510
My circumstances are special.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:04.250
What's that?

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.250
My family is rich!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.880
She's not a very good grownup!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:10.700
I want to be lazy every day.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:15.380
<i>I think I was about to become a 
similar grownup myself, but...</i>

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.860
<i>I'm going to work at a 
proper place in the future.</i>

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:21.700
<i>If I don't, I'm going to end up 
like Midori and that woman.</i>

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.890
<i>Oh yeah, that woman...</i>

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.810
I forgot because of your super long story,

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.040
but now I remembered why I tried to find you.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:30.520
Huh?

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.030
I want you to hire that woman.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.030
I want to get her out of my house.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.240
Our goals align.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.460
Help me.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.670
This'll be fun.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:51.270
I'll make curry udon for dinner tonight!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:57.680
And when Milady's lovely lips 
slurp up those small white noodles...

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.180
The curry splashed out.

00:18:06.540 --> 00:18:07.940
My clothes are going to stain.

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.310
Do not worry.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.200
Huh?

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:14.840
Please wear these clothes 
I've spent countless nights

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.950
sewing with love, and 
have recently completed.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:24.830
And then I'll gobble up the clothes 
stained with curry and her juices.

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:28.210
So wonderful!

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.710
Milady.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.540
Huh?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:32.350
Wear this so you don't get messy again.

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.090
Thank you, Tsubame!

00:18:36.970 --> 00:18:38.540
Here you go.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.520
That'd be crazy!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.400
Curry udon can be used for everything!

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:04.740
Now I'm going to work hard for 
Milady's future together with me!

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:10.650
Welcome back, Milady—

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:17.460
Wh-What's going on...

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:20.800
I see.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.740
So I just have to become a 
maid at your place, then.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:24.470
Yep.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.210
Then I need to change into a maid outfit.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.600
You can just do that later.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.310
No, I can't.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.690
You're going to introduce me 
as a maid in front of Kamoi,

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.240
and if I'm not dressed as a maid, 
I won't be maid-like...

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.240
Then I'd be a maid that's not a maid.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.610
<i>I knew this was going to be a pain.</i>

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:40.490
Hold on.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:41.920
I'll be done in a second.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:47.490
I found a maid's uniform.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:48.850
That's good.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:50.990
I'm curious why you put 
a maid outfit in there,

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:54.170
and why you'd even put stuff 
in there in the first place,

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.750
but asking would be a huge pain, so I'm not.

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:58.480
You never know when your things 
will be taken away from you.

00:19:58.480 --> 00:20:01.480
The thrill is awesome.
 You should totally try it.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.010
I don't think that's something I need.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.260
<i>But now...</i>

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:07.970
Anyway, I'll start changing now.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:09.830
Hey!

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.580
Don't just change in the 
middle of the street!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:14.150
The police are going to come again!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.900
You're the one who brought 
them in the first place.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.910
The police are so uptight.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.980
This reminds me of that one time...

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:30.280
I was trying to get Kamoi to like me,

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.810
so I went to look into little girls...

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.540
I know what's going to happen.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:38.870
<i>I knew there'd be tons of little 
girls at the park on a weekend.</i>

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:39.800
<i>Now, let's see...</i>

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.930
The swings are crazy.

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.180
<i>That's not Kamoi's type.</i>

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.050
<i>There we go!</i>

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:49.180
Kanko-chan, over here!

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:50.680
Little girl...

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:51.310
Huh?

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:53.010
Come here for a second.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:56.290
What's with this texture?

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:58.980
It's a lot finer than an adult's.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:02.870
A silhouette that runs flat 
straight down, without any curves.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.180
Her head is large for her body,

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:07.820
but the way her face is shaped makes 
her look very young and adorable.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.360
All of the parts of her body are tiny,

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.650
but her eyes are about the 
same size as an adult's,

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:14.620
so they actually look larger on her.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:17.340
The way they look makes 
you want to protect them.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:21.650
The way her body is put together 
is completely different than mine.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:33.380
They should listen to people's 
stories a bit better.

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:35.600
Then how about you tell me?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.350
Huh?

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.150
We found the suspicious 
person that was fleeing.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.900
She was in the street taking off her 
clothes and approaching a young girl.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.110
We will take her into custody.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:44.650
Wait! You've got it all wrong!

00:21:45.880 --> 00:21:47.520
We'll listen to your excuses.

00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:49.680
I've said you've got it wrong!

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.940
I knew this would happen.

00:21:51.940 --> 00:21:54.620
Wait, we spent too much time on flashbacks!

00:21:55.020 --> 00:22:00.000
A-And that's why, I'm going to have 
Midorin work here from now on.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.500
That's why... what?

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:06.010
Basically, you're fired!
